      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這個8號野生特區裡的\n野生寶可夢看起來不太對勁。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
