      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "98065E364E0063D0FF0C6C994E185A037684571694518AAA660E2026202600100002011401C40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "死者的怨念附在沙丘上，\n從而變成的寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n很喜歡頭上的鏟子。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
